**/companion_on_demand_relay_test_tmp/

# Local GitHub quota telemetry written beside the tactical snapshot
**/companion-github-quota.json
companion-github-quota.json

# Local command-journal scratch files (tests / operator)
companion_command_journal_test.json
**/companion_command_journal_test.json

# Editor or recovery backups of source
*.backup-*
**/*.backup-*

# On-demand daemon / relay runtime artifacts (local machine)
